{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Crowne Plaza Hotel (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the official \"first guest\" of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memphis_Riverline_Hotel\" title=\"Memphis Riverline Hotel\">Crowne Plaza Hotel</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> in Memphis was also the first guest at the original Holiday Inn 33 years earlier?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memphis_Riverline_Hotel","retrieved":1785313675321},{"title":"Ang Eng Tee (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that scriptwriter <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ang_Eng_Tee\" title=\"Ang Eng Tee\">Ang Eng Tee</a></b> created <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Little_Nyonya\" title=\"The Little Nyonya\">The Little Nyonya</a></i> by drawing inspiration from the rich <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peranakan_Chinese\" title=\"Peranakan Chinese\">Peranakan-Chinese</a> heritage in Singapore's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joo_Chiat_Road\" title=\"Joo Chiat Road\">Joo Chiat</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ang_Eng_Tee","retrieved":1785313675321},{"title":"Tenth Floor (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that memoirist Guy Trebay recalled that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenth_Floor\" title=\"Tenth Floor\">Tenth Floor</a></b>, a New York City nightclub, attracted \"slick and professional gay men who obviously had money\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenth_Floor","retrieved":1785313675322},{"title":"Bruce Gemmell (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that swimmer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruce_Gemmell_(coach)\" title=\"Bruce Gemmell (coach)\">Bruce Gemmell</a></b> \"kept collecting honors and titles like grocery shoppers collect discount coupons\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruce_Gemmell_(coach)","retrieved":1785313675325},{"title":"Seseli campestre (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seseli_campestre\" title=\"Seseli campestre\">Seseli campestre</a></b></i> has both painkilling and anti-inflammatory properties?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seseli_campestre","retrieved":1785313675327},{"title":"Lynda Steadman (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that actress <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynda_Steadman\" title=\"Lynda Steadman\">Lynda Steadman</a></b> wrote and directed <i>From Angel to Old Street</i>, a play set between stops on the London Underground's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_line\" title=\"Northern line\">Northern line</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynda_Steadman","retrieved":1785313675328},{"title":"Juufuutei Raden (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the curator of one museum said that an advertisement for VTuber <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juufuutei_Raden\" title=\"Juufuutei Raden\">Juufuutei Raden</a></b> increased visitors?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juufuutei_Raden","retrieved":1785313675330},{"title":"Mia Bustam (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Indonesian artist <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mia_Bustam\" title=\"Mia Bustam\">Mia Bustam</a></b> took up painting after being left as a single mother of eight?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mia_Bustam","retrieved":1785313675333},{"title":"The Hedgehog Temple (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Hedgehog_Temple\" title=\"The Hedgehog Temple\">The Hedgehog Temple</a></b></i> has more than 100 <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Czech_hedgehog\" t